Mutant: the start compares the system identifiers after it removed the leftover and the last segment. Must fail: a spool of another source system with a leftover of cleanup ends every start with an error that names both, and no file changes; a spool of another source system behind a torn last segment ends every start with an error that names both, and no file changes; a spool of another source system before a headed last segment of the source ends every start with an error that names both, and no file changes.
Apply from the repository root with git apply, and never commit it applied.

